,\"text\":true,\"transport\":\"local\"},\"project_id\":\"f5e500f5-ca6f-4ada-90e8-8a03db717fcf\",\"version_id\":\"e72ecd69-530f-4856-bfa8-67f3e379aff1\"},\"sha256\":\"4773770eef01a6a4574b295d17fa6b31152fd4205d63480de9c5d9065b8e9826\",\"size_bytes\":2998,\"status\":\"complete\",\"storage_uri\":\"rustfs://qa-agent/document-parsing/f5e500f5-ca6f-4ada-90e8-8a03db717fcf/6322633f-3761-4743-b2b6-83db487563f5/111ade0a-c235-45ba-9416-2f644e0eb4ec/0b3de744-f261-440b-a9e0-109be13c0b4a/result.json\",\"task_id\":\"6322633f-3761-4743-b2b6-83db487563f5\",\"warnings\":[]}},\"source_id\":\"498a025d-72a3-577d-8b4b-0ade55b57fc3\",\"source_type\":\"api_doc\",\"uri\":null,\"version\":\"e72ecd69-530f-4856-bfa8-67f3e379aff1\"},\"status\":\"available\"}]}],\"analysis_protocol\":{\"instruction\":\"Return one impact-response-v4 JSON object. Follow the current coordination stage. For every finish, unit_outcome is required and must be analyzed or evidence_insufficient, never null. Use evidence_insufficient when missing evidence prevents completing the task; keep explicit member outcomes. Discovery: read every frozen discovery_task member, propose one set of rule changes citing T refs from fixed_text_evidence. For finish return evidence_outcomes in member order using P/D refs, with outcome and a specific reason for each member. Declare analyzed only after its complete evidence was supplied; insufficient/unprocessed must remain explicit. Never copy group success to every member. Case stage: compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources; return rule_ref/case_impacts, literal paths and actual values; evidence_outcomes is empty. All formal identities/positions/hashes belong to the server. For read return only fixed P/S/C/D reads, no outcome, candidates or evidence_outcomes. Keep negative conditions. Catalogs are metadata, not read evidence. All proposals pending review; deployment unknown. No test execution or official-record changes.\",\"response_schema\":{\